{
  "_doc": [
    "MCP EXCHANGES -- the agent API's transport (docs/AGENT_API.md section 4, node A3/A4), replayed by BOTH active ports:",
    "Rust's mcp::Session and Swift's McpSession. One case = a setup document and an ordered list of steps.",
    "A `client` step sends one JSON-RPC message and expects exactly the listed outgoing messages, in order.",
    "An `artist` step is the artist's act in the app (accept / reject a proposal, or an `edit` that runs `ops` in one",
    "transaction) and expects the notifications the client is sent.",
    "MATCHING: objects match as a SUBSET (keys the expectation names must match; others may be present), arrays match",
    "element-wise with equal length, scalars exactly. \"<any>\" matches any value. An expected OBJECT against an actual",
    "STRING parses the string as JSON first (resources/read's `text`). \"<settled>\" matches the canonical test JSON of the",
    "case's setup document, so a pending preview that leaked into the resource reds.",
    "A proposal's ERROR TEXT for a failing op is not pinned here: it carries each port's own op-error wording.",
    "jas://journal reads the APPLIED journal (up to its head) as {head, transactions: [{name, actor}]}: the machine read-back for an accept."
  ],
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "initialize declares tools and a subscribable resource",
      "setup_svg": "two_rects.svg",
      "steps": [
        {
          "client": {
            "jsonrpc": "2.0",
            "id": 1,
            "method": "initialize",
            "params": {
              "protocolVersion": "2025-06-18",
              "capabilities": {},
              "clientInfo": {
                "name": "t",
                "version": "0"
              }
            }
          },
          "expect": [
            {
              "jsonrpc": "2.0",
              "id": 1,
              "result": {
                "protocolVersion": "2025-06-18",
                "capabilities": {
                  "tools": {},
                  "resources": {
                    "subscribe": true
                  }
                },
                "serverInfo": {
                  "name": "jas",
                  "version": "<any>"
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "client": {
            "jsonrpc": "2.0",
            "method": "notifications/initialized"
          },
          "expect": []
        },
        {
          "client": {
            "jsonrpc": "2.0",
            "id": 2,
            "method": "ping"
          },
          "expect": [
            {
              "jsonrpc": "2.0",
              "id": 2,
              "result": {}
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "the tools are propose and withdraw_proposal, and never accept",
      "setup_svg": "two_rects.svg",
      "steps": [
        {
          "client": {
            "jsonrpc": "2.0",
            "id": 1,
            "method": "tools/list",
            "params": {}
          },
          "expect": [
            {
              "jsonrpc": "2.0",
              "id": 1,
              "result": {
                "tools": [
                  {
                    "name": "propose"
                  },
                  {
                    "name": "withdraw_proposal"
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "a proposal is pending and the settled document is unchanged",
      "setup_svg": "two_rects.svg",
      "steps": [
        {
          "client": {
            "jsonrpc": "2.0",
            "id": 1,
            "method": "tools/call",
            "params": {
              "name": "propose",
              "arguments": {
                "name": "nudge",
                "ops": [
                  {
                    "op": "select_rect",
                    "x": 0,
                    "y": 0,
                    "width": 50,
                    "height": 50,
                    "extend": false
                  },
                  {
                    "op": "move_selection",
                    "dx": 10,
                    "dy": 20
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          },
          "expect": [
            {
              "jsonrpc": "2.0",
              "id": 1,
              "result": {
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "proposal p-0 is shown to the artist; it lands only if the artist accepts it"
                  }
                ],
                "structuredContent": {
                  "proposal": "p-0"
                },
                "isError": false
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "client": {
            "jsonrpc": "2.0",
            "id": 2,
            "method": "resources/read",
            "params": {
              "uri": "jas://document"
            }
          },
          "expect": [
            {
              "jsonrpc": "2.0",
              "id": 2,
              "result": {
                "contents": [
                  {
                    "uri": "jas://document",
                    "mimeType": "application/json",
                    "text": {
                      "pending_proposal": "p-0",
                      "document": "<settled>"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
